herdr WSL file-link patch for herdr v0.9.3
https://github.com/Malorn44/herdr-patches

Under WSL, rewrites file:// links that programs in panes print so Windows
Terminal can open them: file:///home/... becomes
file://wsl.localhost/<distro>/home/... and file:///mnt/c/... becomes
file:///C:/... (Windows Terminal only opens drive paths and wsl.localhost
shares). A Linux path that is a symlink into /mnt/<drive> (e.g. ~/notes ->
a Windows folder) is followed first and links to the drive path, since
Windows can't follow it through the share. That includes links already in
this distro's wsl.localhost form, which Claude Code writes itself. Applies only when
WSL_DISTRO_NAME is set; other links pass through.

Changed files (Apache-2.0 section 4(b) notice): src/protocol/render_ansi.rs.

